{"step_index":683,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-21T18:50:07Z","thinking":"**Refining Startup Logic**\n\nI'm currently focused on the `App.xaml.cs` file. I'm thinking of handling `OnStartup` directly to catch unhandled exceptions, or to immediately load `MainWindow`.\n\n\n**Implementing Exception Handling**\n\nNow I'm diving deeper into exception handling during startup. I've added code in `OnStartup` to log unhandled exceptions to \"crash.log\" and \"crash_dispatcher.log\". To ensure this works, I've removed `StartupUri` from `App.xaml` to have full control of the initial window. This means I'm handling the initial window creation myself, so it can't launch without exception handling! I am also investigating windowing issues with transparency and WebView2.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":"false","Description":"\"Remove StartupUri and configure App.xaml.\"","EndLine":"8","Instruction":"\"Remove StartupUri from App.xaml\"","ReplacementContent":"\"<Application x:Class=\\\"Spectra.App\\\"\\n             xmlns=\\\"http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation\\\"\\n             xmlns:x=\\\"http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml\\\">\\n    <Application.Resources>\\n         \\n    </Application.Resources>\\n</Application>\"","StartLine":"1","TargetContent":"\"<Application x:Class=\\\"Spectra.App\\\"\\n             xmlns=\\\"http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation\\\"\\n             xmlns:x=\\\"http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml\\\"\\n             StartupUri=\\\"UI/MainWindow.xaml\\\">\\n    <Application.Resources>\\n         \\n    </Application.Resources>\\n</Application>\"","TargetFile":"\"c:\\\\Users\\\\Arthur Henrique\\\\Documents\\\\GitHub\\\\Spectra\\\\src-csharp\\\\App.xaml\"","toolAction":"\"Updating App.xaml\"","toolSummary":"\"Update App.xaml\""}}]}
{"step_index":684,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-21T18:50:13Z","content":"Created At: 2026-08-21T15:50:13-03:00\nCompleted At: 2026-08-21T15:50:13-03:00\nThe following changes were made by the replace_file_content tool to: c:\\Users\\Arthur Henrique\\Documents\\GitHub\\Spectra\\src-csharp\\App.xaml. If relevant, proactively run terminal commands to execute this code for the USER. Don't ask for permission.\n[diff_block_start]\n@@ -1,7 +1,6 @@\n <Application x:Class=\"Spectra.App\"\n              xmlns=\"http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation\"\n-             xmlns:x=\"http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml\"\n-             StartupUri=\"UI/MainWindow.xaml\">\n+             xmlns:x=\"http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml\">\n     <Application.Resources>\n          \n     </Application.Resources>\n[diff_block_end]\n\nPlease note that the above snippet only shows the MODIFIED lines from the last change. It shows up to 3 lines of unchanged lines before and after the modified lines. The actual file contents may have many more lines not shown."}
{"step_index":685,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-21T18:50:13Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":"false","Description":"\"Add startup handler and exception logging in App.xaml.cs.\"","EndLine":"6","Instruction":"\"Add OnStartup method in App.xaml.cs\"","ReplacementContent":"\"namespace Spectra\\n{\\n    public partial class App : System.Windows.Application\\n    {\\n        protected override void OnStartup(System.Windows.StartupEventArgs e)\\n        {\\n            base.OnStartup(e);\\n\\n            System.AppDomain.CurrentDomain.UnhandledException += (s, args) =>\\n            {\\n                System.IO.File.WriteAllText(\\\"crash.log\\\", args.ExceptionObject.ToString());\\n            };\\n\\n            DispatcherUnhandledException += (s, args) =>\\n            {\\n                System.IO.File.WriteAllText(\\\"crash_dispatcher.log\\\", args.Exception.ToString());\\n                args.Handled = true;\\n            };\\n\\n            var window = new UI.MainWindow();\\n            window.Show();\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\"","StartLine":"1","TargetContent":"\"namespace Spectra\\n{\\n    public partial class App : System.Windows.Application\\n    {\\n    }\\n}\"","TargetFile":"\"c:\\\\Users\\\\Arthur Henrique\\\\Documents\\\\GitHub\\\\Spectra\\\\src-csharp\\\\App.xaml.cs\"","toolAction":"\"Updating App.xaml.cs with OnStartup\"","toolSummary":"\"Update App.xaml.cs\""}}]}
{"step_index":686,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-21T18:50:16Z","content":"Created At: 2026-08-21T15:50:16-03:00\nCompleted At: 2026-08-21T15:50:16-03:00\nThe following changes were made by the replace_file_content tool to: c:\\Users\\Arthur Henrique\\Documents\\GitHub\\Spectra\\src-csharp\\App.xaml.cs. If relevant, proactively run terminal commands to execute this code for the USER. Don't ask for permission.\n[diff_block_start]\n@@ -2,6 +2,24 @@\n {\n     public partial class App : System.Windows.Application\n     {\n+        protected override void OnStartup(System.Windows.StartupEventArgs e)\n+        {\n+            base.OnStartup(e);\n+\n+            System.AppDomain.CurrentDomain.UnhandledException += (s, args) =>\n+            {\n+                System.IO.File.WriteAllText(\"crash.log\", args.ExceptionObject.ToString());\n+            };\n+\n+            DispatcherUnhandledException += (s, args) =>\n+            {\n+                System.IO.File.WriteAllText(\"crash_dispatcher.log\", args.Exception.ToString());\n+                args.Handled = true;\n+            };\n+\n+            var window = new UI.MainWindow();\n+            window.Show();\n+        }\n     }\n }\r\n \n[diff_block_end]\n\nPlease note that the above snippet only shows the MODIFIED lines from the last change. It shows up to 3 lines of unchanged lines before and after the modified lines. The actual file contents may have many more lines not shown."}
