{"step_index":712,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-21T18:51:27Z","content":"Created At: 2026-08-21T15:51:27-03:00\nCompleted At: 2026-08-21T15:51:27-03:00\nFile Path: `file:///c:/Users/Arthur%20Henrique/Documents/GitHub/Spectra/src-csharp/UI/MainWindow.xaml.cs`\nTotal Lines: 275\nTotal Bytes: 11773\nShowing lines 20 to 80\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n20:         private readonly WindowManager _windowManager = new();\n21:         private readonly HotkeyManager _hotkeyManager = new();\n22:         private readonly ScreenShareMonitor _screenShareMonitor = new();\n23:         private readonly SessionController _sessionController = new();\n24: \n25:         public MainWindow()\n26:         {\n27:             InitializeComponent();\n28:             Loaded += MainWindow_Loaded;\n29:             Closed += MainWindow_Closed;\n30:         }\n31: \n32:         private async void MainWindow_Loaded(object sender, RoutedEventArgs e)\n33:         {\n34:             var helper = new WindowInteropHelper(this);\n35:             IntPtr hwnd = helper.Handle;\n36: \n37:             // Initialize Win32 window management (Capture protection, click-through, transparency)\n38:             _windowManager.Initialize(hwnd);\n39:             _hotkeyManager.Initialize(hwnd);\n40:             RegisterGlobalHotkeys();\n41: \n42:             // Screen share monitoring\n43:             _screenShareMonitor.Start();\n44: \n45:             // Hook HwndSource to receive WM_HOTKEY messages\n46:             var source = HwndSource.FromHwnd(hwnd);\n47:             source.AddHook(WndProc);\n48: \n49:             // Connect SessionController events to UI\n50:             _sessionController.SendToUi += (type, payload) =>\n51:             {\n52:                